      "writtenOn": "2026-09-10T02:08:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Separately from which D-Bus error type is \"more correct\": today,\nneither choice actually helps the Redfish caller, since\nhandleError() only reads the D-Bus error *name*, never the message/\nreason text -- so \"missing key\" and \"key mismatch\" and \"empty file\"\nall produce the exact same generic response regardless. \nGiven that, I\u0027d lean toward: keep this as NotAllowed.To give users more precise insight into what actually failed, a different improvement is probably needed here.",
      "parentUuid": "f657553a_0599e1b0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
