      "writtenOn": "2026-09-11T18:20:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The real gap appears to be in bmcweb\u0027s D-Bus-to-Redfish error translation. I\u0027d prefer the service to return the error that most accurately describes the failure and address any Redfish mapping shortcomings in bmcweb. looks like  NotAllowed is the correct semantic choice here, then let\u0027s look at fixing the corresponding bmcweb behavior rather than encoding that workaround in the service.",
      "parentUuid": "0af846d5_871c275a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 19,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "059fcdb403a3dd5c44e0498e4e5a2e649683b001",
