        "id": 1002931
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-13T02:24:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The certificate manager reports validation failures to bmcweb, which exposes this operation through Redfish. The D-Bus error should therefore allow bmcweb to return an accurate Redfish response.\n\nThe certificate and private key are submitted as one CertificateString property. A missing private key makes that value incomplete and unusable for installation. Mapping NotAllowed to PropertyValueIncorrect in bmcweb would still classify the input as invalid from the Redfish perspective, while adding a special-case translation for this path.\n\nReturning InvalidCertificate directly reflects that the submitted certificate bundle is invalid for installation and already maps to PropertyValueIncorrect.",
